  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\n**According to the question, after interchanging the given two numbers '5 and 9' :**\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 9 × 4 + 5 - 8 ÷ 2 = 25\n\n5 × 4 + 9 - **8 ÷ 2**__ = 25\n\n__**5 × 4**__ + 9 - 4 = 25\n\n__**20 + 9**__ - 4 = 25\n\n__**29 - 4**__ = 25\n\n25 = 25 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 9 - 5 × 4 + 6 ÷ 3 = -30\n\n5 - 9 × 4 + **6 ÷ 3**__ = -30\n\n5 - __**9**____** × 4**__ + 2 = -30\n\n__**5 + 2**__ -36 = -30\n\n__**7 - 36**__ = -30\n\n**-29 ≠ -30 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 9 + 7 × 8 ÷ 4 - 5 = 10\n\n5 + 7 × **8 ÷ 4**__ - 9 = 10\n\n5 + __**7 × 2**__ - 9 = 10\n\n__**5 + 14**__ - 9 = 10\n\n__**19 - 9**__ = 10\n\n10 = 10 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 9 - 4 × 5 + 6 ÷ 2 = -28\n\n5 - 4 × 9 + **6 ÷ 2**__ = -28\n\n5 - __**4 × 9**__ + 3 = -28\n\n__**5 + 3**__ - 36 = -28\n\n__**8 - 36**__ = -28\n\n-28 = -28 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
